  <prompt>Execute 6 Class-B rows (B10, B14, B16, B18, B20, B22) from task-202-punch-list.md's verification matrix marked `NEEDS ROW-LEVEL VERIFY`. For each row, the executor's primary work is: (1) grep-verify the actual current code state per the row's title + verification-matrix evidence, (2) if OPEN, apply the fix per the row's title/effort estimate + row-level tests, (3) if `already-applied` (post-verification-matrix work landed the fix), annotate the punch list row + skip, (4) update the verification matrix with per-row outcome (`applied` / `already-applied` / `not-applicable`). Rows carry BFF hygiene obligations (publish size + delta reporting per CLAUDE.md §10). Rows may collectively reduce below the 25h upper estimate as verification finds landed fixes.</prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Expert in: task 202's punch list format + verification matrix; BFF hygiene per `.claude/constraints/bff-extensions.md`; L2 control-plane KV-binding + credential-config patterns; ADR-032 F.1 asymmetric-registration anti-pattern (row B18 EnvVarValuesOptions ClientSecret refactor); Worker Program.cs registration boundaries (row B20).</role>

  <goal>All 6 rows (B10, B14, B16, B18, B20, B22) have per-row annotations in `notes/task-202-punch-list.md`'s verification matrix with `applied|already-applied|not-applicable` outcome + evidence citation. Applied rows have accompanying tests + build green. BFF publish-size + delta reported in task notes AND PR description per §10 for every BFF-touching row that actually shipped code. Zero rows remain in `NEEDS ROW-LEVEL VERIFY` state after this task lands.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Task 202 SESSION 7 amendment authored the Class-B verification matrix. 6 rows (B10 H6/H7 credential config, B14 I5 ManagedIdentityCredentialFactory TenantId gap, B16 H2b retired-lineage reject, B18 EnvVarValuesOptions → KeyVaultSecretRef refactor, B20 Worker Program.cs:784-795 comment drift, B22 429 wireup at ~30 AI endpoints) are marked `NEEDS ROW-LEVEL VERIFY` — meaning the SESSION 7 verification-pass grep did not conclusively determine current state. These rows require executor-time inspection: some may have LANDED via later Wave G-7/G-8 batches; others may still be OPEN. This task executes the verify-then-decide loop per-row.

**Why verify-first matters**: task 202's punch list header explicitly forbids double-fixing. Row B03 (dispatcher-does-not-exist) went from `original: 24h implementation` to `✅ APPLIED (Wave G — dispatcher live)` in the verification pass. Same double-check discipline applies here — no code changes without verification evidence.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="input">projects/customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1/notes/task-202-punch-list.md (verification matrix — authoritative row state)</file>
      <file role="verify-B10">src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane.Core/Handlers/SolutionImport/CanonicalSolutionCatalog.cs + SolutionImportRejectionCodes.cs (existence confirmed; KV binding for ClientSecret unverified)</file>
      <file role="verify-B14">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Infrastructure/Auth/ManagedIdentityCredentialFactory.cs (existence confirmed; TenantId-scope gap unverified)</file>
      <file role="verify-B16">src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane.Core/Handlers/AiSearch/H2bAiSearchIndexHandler.cs + CanonicalIndexCatalog.cs (existence confirmed; full retired-lineage reject behavior unverified)</file>
      <file role="verify-B18">src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane.Core/Handlers/EnvVarValues/EnvVarValuesOptions.cs + EnvVarValuesWriteRequest.cs (ClientSecret cleartext vs KeyVaultSecretRef seam unverified)</file>
      <file role="verify-B20">src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane.Worker/Program.cs:784-795 (comment content drift unverified this pass)</file>
      <file role="verify-B22">grep across src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/**/*.cs for `Results.Problem` / `429` / `TooManyRequests` at AI-consuming endpoints</file>
