    <criterion testable="true">Zero rows remain in `NEEDS ROW-LEVEL VERIFY` state after this task lands.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Step 9.5 quality gates (code-review + adr-check) invoked for FULL rigor; any Critical findings addressed.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>Justification (CLAUDE.md §11): All 6 rows are MODIFICATION-only — no new components introduced. §11 does not trigger. Existing verification-matrix scoping is authoritative; scope expansion requires escalation per this task's escalation triggers.

Effort range 15-25h is deliberately wide because verification may find rows already landed. Executor should report actual vs estimate in wrap-up to inform sizing of future verify-first waves.</notes>

